0bd>Our journey so far</h2><div class="feature-banner__text" data-v-054940bd><!--[--><p><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if-->In 2023, we put a real focus on AI &amp; intelligent automation and partnered with a leading market specialist, Robiquity, who continues to support us as we navigate the rapidly changing AI landscape. <!--]--><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--></p><p><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if-->We have built a new function that works on delivering initiatives focusing on operational excellence, transforming operations and specifically improving customer experience. Our AI policy and newly created AI forum provide us with a structured, strategic, and risk-aware foundation for delivering AI solutions.<!--]--><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--></p><!--]--></div><!----></div><div class="feature-banner__image" data-v-054940bd><img src="{{ asset('images.prismic.io/ev-mercury/aGvBzEMqNJQqHmbq_AIhumancollaboration93e3.jpg') }}" srcset="https://images.prismic.io/ev-mercury/aGvBzEMqNJQqHmbq_AIhumancollaboration.jpg?auto=format%2Ccompress&amp;rect=1%2C0%2C4996%2C3332&amp;q=50&amp;fit=max&amp;width=640 640w, https://images.prismic.io/ev-mercury/aGvBzEMqNJQqHmbq_AIhumancollaboration.jpg?auto=format%2Ccompress&amp;rect=1%2C0%2C4996%2C3332&amp;q=50&amp;fit=max&amp;width=828 828w, https://images.prismic.io/ev-mercury/aGvBzEMqNJQqHmbq_AIhumancollaboration.jpg?auto=format%2Ccompress&amp;rect=1%2C0%2C4996%2C3332&amp;q=50&amp;fit=max&amp;width=1200 1200w" alt="A human and robot index finger are shown to meet in the middle of the photo" width="1000" height="667" loading="lazy" sizes="(min-width: 992px) 50vw, 100vw" data-v-054940bd></div><!----></div></section><section id="article_link_module" class="section-wrapper article-link-module article-link-module--neutral conditional-section-wrapper" data-slice-type="article_link_module" data-slice-variation="3Column" data-v-10a41d36 data-v-ebc71926><div class="section-wrapper__container" data-v-ebc71926><!--[--><!--v-if--><div class="artic