ntautomationinlogistics-accordion-header-text" data-v-fe7dd93b>What is AI and intelligent automation in logistics?</span><!--]--><div class="e-icon e-accordion-row__chevron" aria-hidden="true" data-icon="chevron_down" data-test-id="chevron_down" data-v-fe7dd93b data-v-d0e20aa0><svg height="24" width="24" style="line-height:24px" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"><title>chevron down</title> <g> <path d="M11.62 14.91C11.51 14.87 11.4 14.8 11.3 14.7L6.7 10.1C6.52 9.92 6.42 9.68 6.42 9.4C6.42 9.12 6.52 8.88 6.7 8.7C6.88 8.52 7.12 8.43 7.4 8.43C7.68 8.43 7.92 8.52 8.1 8.7L12 12.6L15.9 8.7C16.08 8.52 16.32 8.43 16.6 8.43C16.88 8.43 17.12 8.52 17.3 8.7C17.48 8.88 17.57 9.12 17.57 9.4C17.57 9.68 17.48 9.92 17.3 10.1L12.7 14.7C12.6 14.8 12.49 14.87 12.37 14.91C12.26 14.95 12.13 14.97 12 14.97C11.87 14.97 11.74 14.95 11.62 14.91Z" fill="#006BAA"/> </g> </svg></div></button><section id="accordion-content-whatisaiandintelligentautomationinlogistics" aria-labelledby="accordion-button-whatisaiandintelligentautomationinlogistics" class="e-accordion-row__content" data-test-id="whatisaiandintelligentautomationinlogistics-accordion-body-text" style="display:none;" data-v-fe7dd93b><div class="e-accordion-row__body" data-v-fe7dd93b><!--[--><div class="faqs__cms-rich-text" data-v-6bee4b86><!--[--><p><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if-->AI (artificial intelligence) and intelligent automation use technologies to make logistics faster, more efficient, and more reliable. From predicting delivery times to optimising routes, managing operational buildings, these tools help us move your parcels smartly and quickly, whilst ensuring an improved customer experience. <!--]--><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--></p><!--]--></div><!--]--></div></section></div><div class="e-accordion-row" data-test-id="ismypersonaldatasafewithaisystems-accordion" data-v-6bee4b86 data-v-fe7dd93b><button id="accordion-button-ismypersonaldatasafewithaisystems" type="button" aria-controls="acco