mmon questions through AI-powered chatbots and virtual assistants. But don&#39;t worry - our human support team is available when you need to discuss something not in this option. <!--]--><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--></p><!--]--></div><!--]--></div></section></div><div class="e-accordion-row" data-test-id="howdoesaihelpreducetheenvironmentalimpactofdeliveries-accordion" data-v-6bee4b86 data-v-fe7dd93b><button id="accordion-button-howdoesaihelpreducetheenvironmentalimpactofdeliveries" type="button" aria-controls="accordion-content-howdoesaihelpreducetheenvironmentalimpactofdeliveries" aria-expanded="false" class="e-accordion-row__header" data-gtm-track="div-How does AI help reduce the environmental impact of deliveries?-open answer" data-test-id="howdoesaihelpreducetheenvironmentalimpactofdeliveries-accordion-header" data-v-fe7dd93b><!--[--><!----><span class="e-accordion-row__header-text" data-test-id="howdoesaihelpreducetheenvironmentalimpactofdeliveries-accordion-header-text" data-v-fe7dd93b>How does AI help reduce the environmental impact of deliveries?</span><!--]--><div class="e-icon e-accordion-row__chevron" aria-hidden="true" data-icon="chevron_down" data-test-id="chevron_down" data-v-fe7dd93b data-v-d0e20aa0><svg height="24" width="24" style="line-height:24px" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"><title>chevron down</title> <g> <path d="M11.62 14.91C11.51 14.87 11.4 14.8 11.3 14.7L6.7 10.1C6.52 9.92 6.42 9.68 6.42 9.4C6.42 9.12 6.52 8.88 6.7 8.7C6.88 8.52 7.12 8.43 7.4 8.43C7.68 8.43 7.92 8.52 8.1 8.7L12 12.6L15.9 8.7C16.08 8.52 16.32 8.43 16.6 8.43C16.88 8.43 17.12 8.52 17.3 8.7C17.48 8.88 17.57 9.12 17.57 9.4C17.57 9.68 17.48 9.92 17.3 10.1L12.7 14.7C12.6 14.8 12.49 14.87 12.37 14.91C12.26 14.95 12.13 14.97 12 14.97C11.87 14.97 11.74 14.95 11.62 14.91Z" fill="#006BAA"/> </g> </svg></div></button><section id="accordion-content-howdoesaihelpreducetheenvironmentalimpactofdeliveries" aria-labelledby="accordion-button-howdoesaihelpreducetheenvironmentalimpactofdeliveries" class="e-accordion-row__content" data-test-id="howdoesaihelpreducetheenvironmentalimpactofdeliveries-accordion-body-text" style="display:none;" data-v-fe7dd93b><div class="e-accordion-row__body" data-v-fe7dd93b><!--[--><div class="faqs__cms-rich-text" data-v-6bee4b86><!--[--><p><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if-->AI helps us plan smarter routes, reduce fuel consumption, and optimise vehicle loads. This means fewer trips, lower emissions, and a more sustainable service, without compromising on delivery speed. <!--]--><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--></p><!--]--></div><!--]--></div></section></div><div class="e-accordion-row" data-test-id="howreliableareaidrivensystems-accordion" data-v-6bee4b86 data-v-fe7dd93b><button id="accordion-button-howreliableareaidrivensystems" type="button" aria-controls="accordion-content-howreliableareaidrivensystems" aria-expanded="false" class="e-accordion-row__header" data-gtm-track="div-How reliable are AI-driven systems?-open answer" data-test-id="howreliableareaidrivensystems-accordion-header" data-v-fe7dd93b><!--[--><!----><span class="e-accordion-row__header-text" data-test-id="howreliableareaidrivensystems-accordion-header-text" data-v-fe7dd93b>How reliable are AI-driven systems?</span><!--]--><div class="e-icon e-accordion-row__chevron" aria-hidden="true" data-icon="chevron_down" data-test-id="chevron_down" data-v-fe7dd93b data-v-d0e20aa0><svg height="24" width="24" style="line-height:24px" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"><title>chevron down</title> <g> <path d="M11.62 14.91C11.51 14.87 11.4 14.8 11.3 14.7L6.7 10.1C6.52 9.92 6.42 9.68 6.42 9.4C6.42 9.12 6.52 8.88 6.7 8.7C6.88 8.52 7.12 8.43 7.4 8.43C7.68 8.43 7.92 8.52 8.1 8.7L12 12.6L15.9 8.7C16.08 8.52 16.32 8.43 16.6 8.43C16.88 8.43 17.12 8.52 17.3 8.7C17.48 8.88 17.57 9.12 17.57 9.4C17.57 9.68 17.48 9.92 17.3 10.1L12.7 14.7C12.6 14.8 12.49 14.87 12.37 14.91C12.26 14.95 12.13 14.97 12 14.97C11.87 14.97 11.74 14.95 11.62 14.91Z" fill="#006BAA"/> </g> </svg></div></button><section id="accordion-content-howreliableareaidrivensystems" aria-labelledby="accordion-button-howreliableareaidrivensystems" class="e-accordion-row__content" data-test-id="howreliableareaidrivensystems-accordion-body-text" style="display:none;" data-v-fe7dd93b><div class="e-accordion-row__body" data-v-fe7dd93b><!--[--><div class="faqs__cms-rich-text" data-v-6bee4b86><!--[--><p><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if-->Very reliable. Our AI systems are constantly learning and improving. They help us achieve higher delivery success rates, fewer errors, and faster response times - so your parcels are in safe hands. We also don&#39;t just rely on AI-driven systems to make decisions; we use the information to support teams in making faster and more accurate decisions. <!--]--><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--></p><!--]--></div><!--]--></div></section></div><div class="e-accordion-row" data-test-id="whatsnextforaiinlogistics-accordion" data-v-6bee4b86 data-v-fe7dd93b><button id="accordion-button-whatsnextforaiinlogistics" type="button" aria-controls="accordion-content-whatsnextforaiinlogistics" aria-expanded="false" class="e-accordion-row__header" data-gtm-track="div-What&#39;s next for AI in logistics?-open answer" data-test-id="whatsnextforaiinlogistics-accordion-header" data-v-fe7dd93b><!--[--><!----><span class="e-accordion-row__header-text" data-test-id="whatsnextforaiinlogistics-accordion-header-text" data-v-fe7dd93b>What&#39;s next for AI in logistics?</span><!--]--><div class="e-icon e-accordion-row__chevron" aria-hidden="true" data-icon="chevron_down" data-test-id="chevron_down" data-v-fe7dd93b data-v-d0e20aa0><svg height="24" width="24" style="line-height:24px" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"><title>chevron down</title> <g> <path d="M11.62 14.91C11.51 14.87 11.4 14.8 11.3 14.7L6.7 10.1C6.52 9.92 6.42 9.68 6.42 9.4C6.42 9.12 6.52 8.88 6.7 8.7C6.88 8.52 7.12 8.43 7.4 8.43C7