,"default-slice",[],{"title":44,"bodyText":45,"isEco":52,"PaddingTop":52,"PaddingBottom":52,"NoMarginBottom":52,"hasButton":52,"buttonText":20,"buttonLink":53,"image":55},"Our journey so far",[46,49],{"type":23,"text":47,"spans":48,"direction":25},"In 2023, we put a real focus on AI & intelligent automation and partnered with a leading market specialist, Robiquity, who continues to support us as we navigate the rapidly changing AI landscape. ",[],{"type":23,"text":50,"spans":51,"direction":25},"We have built a new function that works on delivering initiatives focusing on operational excellence, transforming operations and specifically improving customer experience. Our AI policy and newly created AI forum provide us with a structured, strategic, and risk-aware foundation for delivering AI solutions.",[],false,{"link_type":54},"Any",{"dimensions":56,"alt":59,"copyright":20,"url":60,"id":61,"edit":62},{"width":57,"height":58},1000,667,"A human and robot index finger are shown to meet in the middle of the photo","ai-and-automation.html\u002F\u002Fimages.prismic.io\u002Fev-mercury\u002FaGvBzEMqNJQqHmbq_AIhumancollaboration.jpg?auto=format%2Ccompress&rect=1%2C0%2C4996%2C3332&w=1000&h=667","aGvBzEMqNJQqHmbq",{"x":34,"y":33,"zoom":34,"background":35},"feature_banner$233f7c7c-5f1b-4b1a-b614-f5bc7733a20d","feature_banner",{"variation":66,"version":17,"items":67,"primary":185,"id":188,"slice_type":189,"slice_label":20},"3Column",[68,91,110,129,148,167],{"Title":69,"Description":74,"Image":78,"Label":20,"UrlText":85,"Url":86,"buttonDataGtmTrack":20,"SecondaryButtonText":20,"SecondaryButtonUrl":90,"secondaryButtonDataGtmTrack":20,"ShowAppDownloadCta":20},[70],{"type":71,"text":72,"spans":73,"direction":25},"heading3","Operations Fleet Lease Management",[],[75],{"type":23,"text":76,"spans":77,"direction":25},"Evri sought an efficient method to automate business processes through low code development and selected Power Platform as the foundation for automation.",[],{"dimensions":79,"alt":80,"copyright":20,"url":81,"id":82,"edit":83},{"width":57,"height":58},"A drone shot of an Evri hub. There are rows of Evri trucks and vans of various sizes stationed at the units across the hub ready to take on parcels. ","ai-and-automation.html\u002F\u002Fimages.prismic.io\u002Fev-mercury\u002FZ7Nygp7c43Q3f4HG_DJI_0034.jpg?auto=format%2Ccompress&rect=0%2C498%2C6000%2C4002&w=1000&h=667","Z7Nygp7c43Q3f4HG",{"x":33,"y":84,"zoom":34,"background":35},498,"Find out more",{"link_type":87,"key":88,"url":89},"Web","c6c90b81-70b4-440a-8bc4-3a01e9324309","ai-and-automation.html\u002F\u002Fwww.evri.com\u002Fnews\u002Fai-fleet-lease-management",{"link_type":54},{"Title":92,"Description":96,"Image":100,"Label":20,"UrlText":85,"Url":106,"buttonDataGtmTrack":20,"SecondaryButtonText":20,"SecondaryButtonUrl":109,"secondaryButtonDataGtmTrack":20,"ShowAppDownloadCta":20},[93],{"type":71,"text":94,"spans":95,"direction":25},"Agentic AI Meets Logistics: Powering our next Wave of Innovation",[],[97],{"type":23,"text":98,"spans":99,"direction":25},"New innovations in Evri’s intelligent automation strategy are setting industry benchmarks while boosting operational efficiency and employee experience.",[],{"dimensions":101,"alt":102,"copyright":20,"url":103,"id":104,"edit":105},{"width":57,"height":58},"A picture of a futuristic robot with a friendly face","ai-and-automation.html\u002F\u002Fimages.prismic.io\u002Fev-mercury\u002FaPpLBLpReVYa3nex_iStock-1414699113.jpg?auto=format,compress","aPpLBLpReVYa3nex",{"x":33,"y":33,"zoom":34,"background":35},{"link_type":87,"key":107,"url":108},"1078b2ed-8e1d-42f2-952e-6fd8a86149e9","ai-and-automation.html\u002F\u002Fwww.evri.com\u002Fnews\u002Fagentic-ai-logistics",{"link_type":54},{"Title":111,"Description":115,"Image":119,"Label":20,"UrlText":85,"Url":125,"buttonDataGtmTrack":20,"SecondaryButtonText":20,"SecondaryButtonUrl":128,"secondaryButtonDataGtmTrack":20,"ShowAppDownloadCta":20},[112],{"type":71,"text":113,"spans":114,"direction":25},"AI & automation at Evri",[],[116],{"type":23,"text":117,"spans":118,"direction":25},"Explore how Evri is using AI and automation to boost efficiency, improve experiences, and safely innovate across the business. ",[],{"dimensions":120,"alt":121,"copyright":20,"url":122,"id":123,"edit":124},{"width":57,"height":58},"A woman wearing an orange blazer is sitting at a desk in front of an open laptop, holding a tablet and pressing the screen with her other hand. There are digitalized symbols in white overlaying the photo to show she is using AI technology","ai-and-automation.html\u002F\u002Fimages.prismic.io\u002Fev-mercury\u002FaGvByUMqNJQqHmbo_ConsumerusingAI.jpg?auto=format%2Ccompress&rect=1%2C0%2C5997%2C4000&w=1000&h=667","aGvByUMqNJQqHmbo",{"x":34,"y":33,"zoom":34,"background":35},{"link_type":87,"key":126,"url":127},"9ef6bac5-6558-425c-a22d-234d5673d3da","ai-and-automation.html\u002F\u002Fwww.evri.com\u002Fnews\u002Fai-and-automation-at-evri",{"link_type":54},{"Title":130,"Description":134,"Image":138,"Label":20,"UrlText":85,"Url":144,"buttonDataGtmTrack":20,"SecondaryButtonText":20,"SecondaryButtonUrl":147,"secondaryButtonDataGtmTrack":20,"ShowAppDownloadCta":20},[131],{"type":71,"text":132,"spans":133,"direction":25},"Smarter customer service",[],[135],{"type":23,"text":136,"spans":137,"direction":25},"Evri revamped its support systems using Power Platform, cutting training time by 20% and boosting call answer times to 91% through a seamless Teams-based solution. ",[],{"dimensions":139,"alt":20,"copyright":20,"url":140,"id":141,"edit":142},{"width":57,"height":58},"ai-and-automation.html\u002F\u002Fimages.prismic.io\u002Fev-mercury\u002FZsc2-0aF0TcGJP5B_hirescs.png?auto=format%2Ccompress&rect=90%2C0%2C1373%2C916&w=1000&h=667","Zsc2-0aF0TcGJP5B",{"x":143,"y":33,"zoom":34,"background":35},90,{"link_type":87,"key":145,"url":146},"0fd3adec-7ccb-40f8-babf-0cf8d35debf3","ai-and-automation.html\u002F\u002Fwww.evri.com\u002Fnews\u002Fcustomer-service-response-and-wrap-up-use-case",{"link_type":54},{"Title":149,"Description":153,"Image":157,"Label":20,"UrlText":85,"Url":163,"buttonDataGtmTrack":20,"SecondaryButtonText":20,"SecondaryButtonUrl":166,"secondaryButtonDataGtmTrack":20,"ShowAppDownloadCta":20},[150],{"type":71,"text":151,"spans":152,"direction":25},"Boosting productivity with Copilot Chat",[],[154],{"type":23,"text":155,"spans":156,"direction":25},"Evri rolled out Microsoft 365 Copilot Chat to 3,800+ colleagues, driving smarter workflows, better collaboration, and secure AI adoption through 15+ engaging roadshows. ",[],{"dimensions":158,"alt":20,"copyright":20,"url":159,"id":160,"edit":161},{"width":57,"height":58},"ai-and-automation.html\u002F\u002Fimages.prismic.io\u002Fev-mercury\u002FaGvD4EMqNJQqHmeF_20220725-EVRI-PeoplePhotography-360.jpg?auto=format%2Ccompress&rect=2%2C0%2C6237%2C4160&w=1000&h=667","aGvD4EMqNJQqHmeF",{"x":162,"y":33,"zoom":34,"background":35},2,{"link_type":87,"key":164,"url":165},"ca7fbf04-94ae-4f24-b2e9-ed3033d06413","ai-and-automation.html\u002F\u002Fwww.evri.com\u002Fnews\u002Fevri-launches-microsoft-365-copilot-chat",{"link_type":54},{"Title":168,"Description":172,"Image":176,"Label":20,"UrlText":85,"Url":181,"buttonDataGtmTrack":20,"SecondaryButtonText":20,"SecondaryButtonUrl":184,"secondaryButtonDataGtmTrack":20,"ShowAppDownloadCta":20},[169],{"type":71,"text":170,"spans":171,"direction":25},"New AI and data apprenticeship programmes",[],[173],{"type":23,"text":174,"spans":175,"direction":25},"A new apprenticeship is strengthening data and artificial intelligence (AI) skills across the Evri workforce.",[],{"dimensions":177,"alt":20,"copyright":20,"url":178,"id":179,"edit":180},{"width":57,"height":58},"ai-and-automation.html\u002F\u002Fimages.prismic.io\u002Fev-mercury\u002FaYTVgt0YXLCxVdjU_20220725-EVRI-PeoplePhotography-376.jpg?auto=format%2Ccompress&rect=2%2C0%2C6237%2C4160&w=1000&h=667","aYTVgt0YXLCxVdjU",{"x":162,"y":33,"zoom":34,"background":35},{"link_type":87,"key":182,"url":183},"d7345f43-6556-4d48-8363-7c4e92a6c8d2","ai-and-automation.html\u002F\u002Fwww.evri.com\u002Fpress\u002Fevri-ai-data-apprenticeship",{"link_type":54},{"SectionTitle":186,"SectionDescription":187,"theme":20},[],[],"article_link_module$fe011774-b8a9-4175-8d2b-45d43d1bcb6e","article_link_module",{"variation":41,"version":17,"items":191,"primary":228,"id":230,"slice_type":231,"slice_label":20},[192,198,204,210,216,222],{"questionTitle":193,"questionBody":194},"What is AI and intelligent automation in logistics?",[195],{"type":23,"text":196,"spans":197,"direction":25},"AI (artificial intelligence) and intelligent automation use technologies to make logistics faster, more efficient, and more reliable. From predicting delivery times to optimising routes, managing operational buildings, these tools help us move your parcels smartly and quickly, whilst ensuring an improved customer experience. ",[],{"questionTitle":199,"questionBody":200},"Is my personal data safe with AI systems?",[201],{"type":23,"text":202,"spans":203,"direction":25},"Yes. We use advanced encryption and strict data protection protocols to keep your information secure. Our AI systems are designed to comply with global privacy standards like GDPR, ensuring your data is handled responsibly. ",[],{"questionTitle":205,"questionBody":206},"How does automation affect customer service?",[207],{"type":23,"text":208,"spans":209,"direction":25},"AI and automation enhance customer service by providing instant answers to common questions through AI-powered chatbots and virtual assistants. But don't worry - our human support team is available when you need to discuss something not in this option. ",[],{"questionTitle":211,"questionBody":212},"How does AI help reduce the environmental impact of deliveries?",[213],{"type":23,"text":214,"spans":215,"direction":25},"AI helps us plan smarter routes, reduce fuel consumption, and optimise vehicle loads. This means fewer trips, lower emissions, and a more sustainable service, without compromising on delivery speed. ",[],{"questionTitle":217,"questionBody":218},"How reliable are AI-driven systems?",[219],{"type":23,"text":220,"spans":221,"direction":25},"Very reliable. Our AI systems are constantly learning and improving. They help us achieve higher delivery success rates, fewer errors, and faster response times - so your parcels are in safe hands. We also don't just rely on AI-driven systems to make decisions; we use the information to support teams in making faster and more accurate decisions. ",[],{"questionTitle":223,"questionBody":224},"What's next for AI in logistics?",[225],{"type":23,"text":226,"spans":227,"direction":25},"The future is exciting! We're continually exploring innovative ideas that can help our business and ultimately enhance customer experience. Our goal is to keep pushing boundaries to become a true market disruptor and to serve you better. ",[],{"title":229},"Frequently asked questions","frequently_asked_questions$8c4e7783-898b-4598-8728-081e108a938e","frequently_asked_questions",[15,40,65,190],["Reactive",234],{"$sglobal-feature-switches":235,"$sclients":302,"$sglobal-basket-count":20},{"abtasty":236,"accessibe":240,"appPromoBanner":243,"autoDivertUpdates":246,"awin":249,"bulkInternational":252,"bulkSendEnabled":255,"businessAccountForm75Enabled":258,"enableBasketCount":261,"enableBulkPhaseTwo":264,"euCustomsDuty":267,"groovyAdvert":270,"newInternationalSendFlow":273,"newinternationalpages":280,"oohPreferenceFlag":284,"opentel":287,"premium":290,"savedCards":293,"smallParcelSize":296,"yourPricesDrawer":299},{"_createdAt":237,"_updatedAt":238,"enabled":239},"2025-11-05T15:39:37.217Z","2025-11-05T15:39:37.452Z",true,{"_createdAt":241,"_updatedAt":242,"enabled":239},"2025-07-15T08:41:16.873Z","2025-10-28T11:52:03.675Z",{"_createdAt":244,"_updatedAt":245,"enabled":52},"2026-03-06T12:16:35.816Z","2026-03-06T12:16:36.662Z",{"_createdAt":247,"_updatedAt":248,"enabled":52},"2026-04-30T13:26:45.107Z","2026-04-30T13:26:45.355Z